{"3279900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "C.A.B.A.", "steam_appid": 3279900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/c9bd934037d9a792ecc844a58028ef27.avif?t=1786198154\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>C.A.B.A. is our take on the Backrooms metro level, a subterranean liminal space that, surprisingly, hasn't been explored in video games yet. You woke up at Pirámides station. You need to get out. Something in the station doesn't want you t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/d3008ad2adccd16f32f5bc3052ecf307.avif?t=1786198154\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/38a2c7f9f70928f287d8e5c3f6a89f2e.avif?t=1786198154\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk throught Pirámides, a ghost station on Buenos Aires' Line H. Empty, but not abandoned. The atmosphere does the work. Also available in VR Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/6e09bc8572381e0f153d3d7c4d7bd4cf.poster.avif?t=1786198154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/6e09bc8572381e0f153d3d7c4d7bd4cf.webm?t=1786198154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/e853e3d2b8d4077fb29881a20e38f600.avif?t=1786198154\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station has its own rules. To progress you need to understand them. Explore every corner, pay attention to the details, collect what you find and work through the puzzles to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/6111f03724e4287cf25569f2f8a98f33.poster.avif?t=1786198154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/6111f03724e4287cf25569f2f8a98f33.webm?t=1786198154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/47c435dd517153125ba2f699af811734.avif?t=1786198154\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aesthetic is intentional. Retro game references, lighting that shouldn't work this well, and a found footage presentation that makes everything feel like it was recorded by someone who had no idea what they were about to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/54a1d8d9f84b50ff47d619e146a35231.poster.avif?t=1786198154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/54a1d8d9f84b50ff47d619e146a35231.